{
 "_what": "Apple's documented values for NSPrivacyCollectedDataType, so the gate can check the manifest's VOCABULARY and not just its presence.",
 "_why": "The shipped manifest declared NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeHealthAndFitness, which Apple does not document (it documents ...TypeHealth and ...TypeFitness separately, and no combined key). An unrecognised value maps to no category, so the manifest declared no health data at all while the binary links HealthKit.framework and holds com.apple.developer.healthkit. It survived because the only assertion over this file PINNED that invalid key as its calibration - an assertion that can never fail on vocabulary.",
